OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 6 DEC
OL,4,G1500FGilles Peterson
OL,5,     GGilles is back with an intimate
OL,6,     Gsession from singer-songwriter
OL,7,     GJamie Woon. Plus, new music and a
OL,8,     Gspecial voice note from Flea.
OL,9,G1800FThe Craig Charles Funk and Soul
OL,10,     FShow
OL,11,     GBrooklyn's Johnny Burgos delivers
OL,12,     Gthis week's Trunk of Funk,
OL,13,     Gshowing exactly why he's become a
OL,14,     Gkey player in the modern low-
OL,15,     Grider soul movement.
OL,16,G2100FDon Letts' Culture Clash Radio
OL,17,     GDon's Saturday night selections
OL,18,     Gcross time, space and genre. This
OL,19,     Gweek, he's got culture clash cuts
OL,20,     Gby Roots Manuva, Damian Marley,
OL,21,     GJevetta Steele, Gorillaz and
OL,22,     GKennebec.
